    "traits": "Auditory, Fear",
    "description": "<p>AUDITORY FEAR SAVE UNLIVING-GHOST</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Level 8, Essence Attacks</p>\n<p>Your grief tears loose as a keening cry that freezes courage in the living.</p>\n<p>Action: 2 AP</p>\n<p>You emit a sorrowful wail affecting creatures within a 60-foot radius that can hear you. Each affected creature must attempt a Will save. On a failure, it becomes frightened 2. On a fumble, it becomes frightened 4. On a success, the creature is immune to your Wail of the Departed for 1 minute.</p>\n<p>An Unliving Ghost feat (Pillars of Faith, Chapter 9), granted as an innate spell-like at will: no PP, a level-based Will save. A creature that saves is immune to your Wail for 1 minute.</p>"
